# .easignore — controls what gets uploaded to EAS Build for this artifact.
# When present, this REPLACES .gitignore for EAS upload selection.
# Goal: ship only what's needed to build the mobile app from a pnpm monorepo.

# ---- Heavy repo-root junk we never need on EAS ----
.git/
.gitignore
attached_assets/
.local/
.cache/
.pnpm-store/
.replit
.replit-artifact/
replit.md
*.log

# ---- Root-level node_modules (EAS will re-install) ----
node_modules/

# ---- Other artifacts (NOT needed to build the mobile app) ----
artifacts/api-server/
artifacts/customer-wallet/
artifacts/marketing-site/
artifacts/restaurant-platform/
artifacts/mockup-sandbox/

# ---- Within tabletrack-mobile itself ----
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/node_modules/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/.expo/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/dist/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/build/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/static-build/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/server/
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/MOBILE_AUDIT.md
artifacts/tabletrack-mobile/scripts/

# ---- General junk ----
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.turbo/
**/.next/
**/dist/
**/build/
